; Custom NSIS English Language strings for Antigravity Shield
; Replaces the intimidating "Uninstall before installing" screen with a clear "Upgrade" message

LangString alreadyInstalled ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Upgrade ${PRODUCTNAME}"
LangString olderOrUnknownVersionInstalled ${LANG_ENGLISH} "An existing installation of ${PRODUCTNAME} was detected on your system.$\r$\n$\r$\nUpgrading will install the newest version while safely preserving all your accounts, settings, and cached data."
LangString uninstallBeforeInstalling ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Upgrade to new version (Recommended — All your data, accounts & settings are preserved)"
LangString dontUninstall ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Overwrite existing installation directly"
